        "ActivityBg": "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/UiActivityBase/UiActivityBaseQuanjingv401.png",
        "ActivityTitle": "Special Dispatch: Wasteland Merchant",
        "ActivityDes": "Requirements:\\nCommandant Lv.52\\n\\nEvent Info:\\n1. Special Dispatch: Wasteland Merchant consists of 4 areas, which will be available over time. Each area consists of various blocks. Clear a block to unlock the adjacent blocks.\\n2. Consume [Floating Processors] on [Battle] or [Dispatch] to obtain Block Contribution and event token [Trial Prototypes].\\n3. When there is enough Block Contribution contributed by all the commandants on the server, the block will be cleared and all the commandants will receive the reward and bonuses of the block.\\n4. This event introduces a new Auction House system. You can clear stages to obtain collectibles and upgrade the Collection Room for rewards; you can also trade collectibles using tokens in the Auction House.\\n5. Use collectibles to upgrade the Collection Room and light up rare collectibles to receive generous rewards.\\n6. Clear a block of the designated character to receive the corresponding trial character. The character will also gain a huge boost in battles of the event.\\n7. Clear the [Dark Block] in the first area to unlock [Phase Results]. Results will be calculated every hour to grant [Trial Prototypes]. With the clearance of the [Dark Blocks] in the areas, the reward granted every hour will get better.\\n8. Special Supplies: [Trial Prototypes] earned from the event can be exchanged for amazing rewards in the [Special Supplies].",
        "ActivityPrefabPath": null,
        "Params": "[80176]",
        "ConditionId": 84601200.0,
        "ShowBeginTime": "After the update on 2025-12-23",
        "ShowEndTime": null,
        "ShowAllTime": null
    },
